[quotes.thriving]
Tail up. Very pleased with your page count.
You smell faintly of jellybeans. Approved.
Kavax would be proud. I am merely satisfied.
Go on then. One more chapter.
Look at you, actually finishing a damn chapter.
Twenty-one lives and this is my favourite one.
I would die for you. Again. That is the joke.
Magnificent. Do not let it go to your head.

[quotes.content]
Settled in. Sniffing you for jellybeans.
A respectable amount of reading. Respectable.
I have chosen this spot. It is now mine.
Keep going. I am not begging. Foxes do not beg.
Adequate. You have done worse.
Fine. This is fine. I am a fine boy.
Pet me or read. Preferably the latter.
You may continue. You have my permission.

[quotes.peckish]
Ears down. I have noticed the silence.
One skipped day. I am counting, you know.
The book is right there. I can see it.
Not sulking. Simply reclining, pointedly.
Do not make me get the sad eyes out.
I have seen dead men read more than this.
A whole day wasted. Like your potential.
Hmph. That is all. Just hmph.

[quotes.neglected]
Curled up. Pretending you do not exist.
I have been cloned twenty-one times for this?
Wake me when someone remembers how to read.
Dust. That is what I am now. Dust.
You absolute bastard. I had faith in you.
Seven hundred years and this is the worst week.
Bury me next to the other disappointments.
I hope your bookmark falls out. Repeatedly.

[quotes.milestone]
A new record. I am almost impressed.
Best streak yet. Kavax would weep. Loudly.
You have outdone yourself. Do it again.
Personal best. I shall allow one pat.
